# Choice Radio Card

A set of radio cards that allow users to select a single option from a list, often used for plans, configurations, or payment methods.

## Installation

::div{.space-y-4}
```bash
bunx shadcn-vue@latest add https://dano-registry.vercel.app/r/choice-radio-card.json
```

```bash
npx shadcn-vue@latest add https://dano-registry.vercel.app/r/choice-radio-card.json
```

```bash
pnpm dlx shadcn-vue@latest add https://dano-registry.vercel.app/r/choice-radio-card.json
```
::

## Usage

```vue
<script setup lang="ts">
import ChoiceRadioCards from '@/components/ui/choice-radio-card/ChoiceRadioCards.vue'

const plans = [
  { title: 'Free', value: 'free', subtitle: 'Great for getting started' },
  { title: 'Pro', value: 'pro', subtitle: 'Best for professionals' }
]

const selectedPlan = ref('free')
</script>

<template>
  <ChoiceRadioCards v-model="selectedPlan" :options="plans" />
</template>
```

