### Registry dependencies

::deps{type="shadcn" :external="false" :dependencies='[{"text": "radio-group"}, {"text": "label"}]'}
::

### Props

| Prop | Type | Default | Required | Description |
| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |
| `options` | `Array` | `undefined` | `true` | Array of option objects: `{ title, value, subtitle?, icon? }`. |
| `type` | `'standard' \| 'hidden'` | `'standard'` | `false` | The visual style of the cards. |
| `defaultValue` | `string` | `undefined` | `false` | The initial selected value. |
| `v-model` | `string` | `undefined` | `false` | Two-way binding for the selected value. |

### Slots

| Slot | Description |
| :--- | :--- |
| `icon` | Scoped slot to customize the icon for each option. Receives `{ option }` as scope. |
